                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Arcade Love is a collection of short minigames. Your performance of these minigames is graded with a gaming age (the lower the age, the better your performance). I'm not great at the action game skill test minigames. I find them to be the jankiest minigames in the collection. They also tend to have the most awkward controls (they're still fun minigames, but they are my personal least favourite part of the collection). \n\n\nShmup Skill Test isn't too different here than the other version of the game which is also on Steam if you're interested in trying it. Something worth noting is that some minigames are new while others from the standalone version of this game have been removed entirely. \n\n\nLast but not least, we have Combat Zeal, another collection of shmup minigames. Unlike with some of the minigames from shmup skill test or action game skill test, these minigames generally don't require button mashing. If you like shmups, you might be interested in Arcade Love since most of the minigames here are of the shmup variety. \n\nBuy this on sale.",
